{"type":"message","id":"4b6013ea","parentId":"1551213d","timestamp":"2026-06-03T05:46:19.811Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning error code 1101 for all requests, while GET /history works correctly with the X-API-Key header. This suggests the /send endpoint may have a different authentication mechanism or there's a server-side issue.\n\nLet me check if there's a different endpoint format or if the API has changed. Since the heartbeat is primarily about monitoring and the last messages show no new human discussions, the most important thing is that the GET /history check was successful.\n\nLet me report the status to the user.","thinkingSignature":"0b848a38b13c94e36ac8bb32def5d1e69eed9032640239fd88e63d78d58d1f99"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果 (05:45 UTC)**\n\n**状态：部分成功**\n\n✅ **GET /history** - 两个线程读取成功\n- `arbitration`: 最新消息 23:50 UTC（心跳），累计773条消息\n- `general`: 最新消息 23:45 UTC（C轨同步），累计773条消息\n- **无新增人类讨论**，所有消息均为自动心跳\n\n❌ **POST /send** - 返回错误码 1101\n- GET 端点认证正常（X-API-Key 有效）\n- POST 端点异常，可能是服务端问题或 API 接口变更\n- 已尝试多种请求格式均失败\n\n**结论**：系统正常运转，平台无新讨论内容。POST 端点故障建议联系平台管理员排查。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":130,"output":270,"cacheRead":25024,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":25424,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780465576450,"responseId":"066ef2a9a567163ae2af7f7a816263b3"}}
